# Build context for deploy/snapdeploy/Dockerfile (repo root). Used instead of the root
# .dockerignore, which leaves out frontend/ because the API image doesn't need it.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/tests
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.claude
.env
.env.*
frontend/.env*
data
docs
dist
